{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/25411dc7932d1d283de033b8af46b5a4.poster.avif?t=1773936238\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF showing Lampareiro and Folhiel interacting with Steam wishlist buttons.\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/25411dc7932d1d283de033b8af46b5a4.webm?t=1773936238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/25411dc7932d1d283de033b8af46b5a4.mp4?t=1773936238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/22362bf0f08cb40b5a6756e9efa22028.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Welcome! Remember the 90s and 2000s, when games inspired generations?\" width=700 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EDEN\u2019S FRONTIER</strong> seeks to reignite the essence of classics that shaped an entire generation and conquered the world, while delivering a brand-new experience, reimagined for modern times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a <strong>real-time action RPG</strong> focused on direct combat and fluid gameplay, EDEN\u2019S FRONTIER blends <strong>HD anime-style pixel art with fully 3D environments</strong>. You begin your journey with Blu, one of the three protagonists, venturing into the unknown toward a mysterious new place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/a85be7042f70cab56a2e9e6bff17fd5c.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Bleumitas Cave, a subterranean environment with ruins, explorable area.\" width=1560 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/0373747906dae4a95dc68012134c6ddd.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"A Guide to the Frontiers \u2013 Explore, Battle, Collect, and Rebuild Spiral\" width=700 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a story built around &quot;forgotten truths&quot; and deep reflections on the meaning of life, you will cross a new frontier toward Eden itself, discovering races, kingdoms, and hidden threats that emerge primarily at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One of the game\u2019s core systems is its <strong>day-and-night</strong> cycle, where <strong>unique events directly impact your adventure</strong>. But the possibilities go far beyond that:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a &quot;mysterious world&quot; in your own way, revisiting familiar locations as well, including the <strong>Liberdade district in S\u00e3o Paulo, Brazil</strong>, famous for its strong Asian community;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/2bb6c211d3772767442ae4fc81e5a915.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Liberdade, S\u00e3o Paulo, Brazil, an explorable urban environment.\" width=1560 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of Hiro (the protagonist of the EDEN\u2019S FRONTIER comics), recruit beings to the Spiral City;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible and playable card</strong> systems, allowing you to upgrade and equip cards to support real-time action combat;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic soundtrack and visual style designed to resonate with all generations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more\u2026 Revealing itself little by little!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/43839ba7eba20589b4ace090f09e979b.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Chlorophyll Forest, a natural area with dense vegetation, explorable setting.\" width=1560 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/3c38acca15f216a37d2b99da5594c496.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Universe \u2013 Discover Races and Stories\" width=700 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/9ca390a172e2792ae64ffa4babb4073c.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Title screen of EDEN&#039;S FRONTIER, used in the beta version.\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game\u2019s narrative is deeply intertwined with a 100% original and free comic series set in the same universe. Through it, you are introduced to <strong>Seth</strong>, <strong>Maria</strong>, and <strong>Blu</strong>, the protagonists of the game, while learning more about the races and regions they inhabit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27a4 So, who are these beings?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the <strong>Bluveils</strong>, a race of small blue creatures rarely seen by the naked eye due to their ability to hide and dig tunnels reaching depths of several kilometers. Their kind possesses an innate ability known as <i>Spark</i>, which our protagonist Blu seemingly lacks\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/0f4ef929381906edc669f042c4866dc3.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Bluveils, Folhiel, and Marisan, some of the characters in EDEN&#039;S FRONTIER.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras_big/0f4ef929381906edc669f042c4866dc3.webp?t=1773936238 width=1560 height=827 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unmistakable <strong>Ventauri</strong> stand out not only for their appearance, but for their natural instinct for trade. With extremely resilient bodies and vibrant plumage, they travel selling goods or offering a wide range of services;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/adcc0367546beec10c1311a088bdaef9.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Hiro and Ventauri in EDEN&#039;S FRONTIER.\" width=650 height=613 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and vital, the <strong>Folhiel</strong> are known as the <i>\u201c</i>conscious seeds<i>\u201d</i> of Eden. Their peculiar appearance resembling small onions with curious expressions may draw smiles at first glance, but their importance goes far beyond their simple form. They are guardians of nature itself;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/b33192c15a5aea3e4c3a17e24ef09f86.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Maria, a playable character presented in different expressions.\" width=885 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, mold monsters, other yet-to-be-discovered creatures, and even clowns (?) inhabit Eden! Begin your journey in the Chlorophyll Forest and uncover unforgettable regions in an EPIC adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27a4 Don\u2019t forget to visit our <strong>official website</strong> and <strong>follow us on social media</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397010?t=1773936238","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/37e8e0effc207d2967181c8a31bff92ff75be139/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773936238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/c5049f4b980477cdbcbc4c51927959e3979ee0e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773936238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/c5049f4b980477cdbcbc4c51927959e3979ee0e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773936238","categories":[{"description":