</ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/2bb6c211d3772767442ae4fc81e5a915.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Liberdade, S\u00e3o Paulo, Brazil, an explorable urban environment.\" width=1560 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of Hiro (the protagonist of the EDEN\u2019S FRONTIER comics), recruit beings to the Spiral City;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible and playable card</strong> systems, allowing you to upgrade and equip cards to support real-time action combat;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic soundtrack and visual style designed to resonate with all generations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more\u2026 Revealing itself little by little!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/43839ba7eba20589b4ace090f09e979b.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Chlorophyll Forest, a natural area with dense vegetation, explorable setting.\" width=1560 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/3c38acca15f216a37d2b99da5594c496.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Universe \u2013 Discover Races and Stories\" width=700 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"te