trade. With extremely resilient bodies and vibrant plumage, they travel selling goods or offering a wide range of services;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/adcc0367546beec10c1311a088bdaef9.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Hiro and Ventauri in EDEN&#039;S FRONTIER.\" width=650 height=613 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and vital, the <strong>Folhiel</strong> are known as the <i>\u201c</i>conscious seeds<i>\u201d</i> of Eden. Their peculiar appearance resembling small onions with curious expressions may draw smiles at first glance, but their importance goes far beyond their simple form. They are guardians of nature itself;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/b33192c15a5aea3e4c3a17e24ef09f86.avif?t=1773936238\" alt=\"Maria, a playable character presented in different expressions.\" width=885 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, mold monsters, other yet-to-be-discovered creatures, and even clowns (?) inhabit Eden! Begin your journey in the Chlorophyll Forest and uncover unforgettable regions in an EPIC adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27a4 Don\u2019t forget to visit our <strong>official website</strong> and <strong>follow us on social media</strong>.</p>","developers":["Frontiers Group Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25